# Child-process following, mixed architecture, per-process symbols.
# Run with: aidbg --exe tests/spawner.exe --script tests/reg_children.ajs
#
# The breakpoint is set before `run`, so it is unresolved until the x86 child
# (target32.exe) loads its PDB. `processes` must then show the x64 parent next
# to the x86 child, and `regs` must switch to the x86 register set.
break accumulate
run
continue
processes
regs rip
kill
